<title>DENMARK: Landwirtschafliche Rentenbank ups 4% bond amount.</title>
<headline>Landwirtschafliche Rentenbank ups 4% bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Landwirtschafliche Rentenbank raised an existing four percent bond due 2003 by 50 million crowns to 560 million crowns, arranger Dresdner Bank said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
